function loadWorkspace(){workspaceKey=[phase,sub,task].join('/');const cached=workspaceStore[workspaceKey],seed=phase==='研发'?taskSeed():null;baseline=task==='技术调研'?['需求确认纪要.md','涂层性能指标.csv']:[];
 if(cached){todos=cached.todos;docs=cached.docs;messages=cached.messages||[]}else if(phase==='项目立项'&&task==='技术调研'){todos=structuredClone(stored.todos||[]);docs=structuredClone(stored.docs||{});docs['技术调研报告.md']=docs['技术调研报告.md']||report()}else{const items=seed?.todos||['确认本任务目标与输入资料','整理任务材料及待确认问题','复核交付物与推进条件'];const completed=taskState(phase,task)==='已完成';todos=items.map(text=>({text,done:completed,status:completed?'done':'todo',owner:'林晓',due:'',priority:'normal'}));docs=seed?structuredClone(seed.assets):{[task+'—准备清单.md']:'# '+task+' · 准备清单\n\n交互原型模板，请补充实际资料。\n\n'+items.map(t=>'- '+t).join('\n')}}
 if(flowWorkspace&&flowWorkspace.phase===phase&&flowWorkspace.sub===sub&&flowWorkspace.node.name===task)for(const a of flowWorkspace.assets||[])if(!Object.hasOwn(docs,a.name))docs[a.name]=a.text||'该资产暂不支持文本预览，请保留本机原件。';todos.forEach(t=>{t.status=t.status||(t.done?'done':'todo');t.owner=t.owner||'林晓';t.due=t.due||'';t.priority=t.priority||'normal'});conversationMap=cached?.conversations||{workspace:messages};conversationId=cached?.conversationId||'workspace';conversationDrafts=cached?.conversationDrafts||{};messages=TaskDialogueModel.thread(conversationMap,conversationId);draftText=conversationDrafts[conversationId]||'';if(q('#research-prompt'))q('#research-prompt').value=draftText;workspaceView=computationWorkspace()?'list':cached?.workbenchView||'canvas';files=sessionFiles.get(workspaceKey)||[];if(phase==='项目立项'&&task==='技术调研'&&!cached?.technicalAgentExample){const route=todos.find(t=>/梳理候选技术路线/.test(t.text)),literature=todos.find(t=>/补充专利/.test(t.text));if(route){UnifiedTasks.assignAgent(route,'方案规划 Agent');Object.assign(route,{type:'调研',status:'doing',done:false,agentWorking:true})}if(literature){UnifiedTasks.assignAgent(literature,'文献调研 Agent');Object.assign(literature,{type:'调研',status:'done',done:true})}technicalComplete=false;workspaceStore[workspaceKey]={...workspaceStore[workspaceKey],technicalAgentExample:1}}if((cached?.agentExamplesVersion||0)<2&&!(phase==='项目立项'&&task==='技术调研')&&!isLocked()){if(!cached?.agentExamplesVersion)UnifiedTasks.applyAgentExamples(todos);UnifiedTasks.applyAgentTaskPack(todos,researchCatalog());workspaceStore[workspaceKey]={...workspaceStore[workspaceKey],agentExamplesVersion:2}}save();
}
